Dispute resolution process:
As a supplier, if you have a query or dispute relating to a payment you believe is owed to you, please email the following details to accountspayable@napp.co.uk: 
a. Full supplier name, address; 
b. The name of your point of contact; 
c. Invoice number for the payment you are querying; 
d. Full details of your complaint; 
e. Upon receipt of all of the above details, we commit to acknowledge receipt of your email within 5 working days, and may request further information to be able to respond in full. 

We will investigate your query using the details provided and speak with relevant members of our business, including members of the legal department if necessary, and respond in full within 14 days of the date of our acknowledgement to you.

