Dispute resolution process:
Initial contact is the central finance team. Appropriate queries, from suppliers, are raised with the respective budget managers within the company. Following resolution of the query, which may take up to 10 days, we will either:
- revert back to the supplier with validated reasons for non-payment;
- include payments with the due payments on the next available payment run.

