As a supplier, if you have a query or dispute relating to a payment you believe is owed to you by Bard Pharmaceuticals Limited, please email the following details below, to accountspayable@napp.co.uk and BARD.APQueries@mundipharma.com:
a. Full supplier name, address; b. The name of your point of contact;
c. Invoice number for the payment you are querying;
d. Full details of your complaint;
